---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Policy — Zarlino Audio"
  description="Zarlino Audio's 14-day money-back policy for plugin purchases."
  canonicalURL="https://zarlinoaudio.com/legal/refunds"
  schemaType="website"
>
  <main class="relative z-[1] bg-[#050505] min-h-screen pt-24 pb-24 px-6 md:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[820px] mx-auto">
      <nav class="mb-8 font-['Inter'] text-[13px] text-[#64748B]">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Zarlino Audio</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span class="text-[#94A3B8]">Refund Policy</span>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-semibold text-white text-[clamp(32px,4.5vw,48px)] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em]">
        Refund Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 font-['IBM_Plex_Mono'] text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[#64748B]">
        Version 1.0 · 2 October 2026
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 font-['Inter'] text-[16px] text-[#94A3B8] leading-[1.8] space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-semibold text-white text-[22px] mb-3">14-day money back</h2>
          <p>
            If a Zarlino Audio plugin doesn't work for you, ask for a refund within <strong class="text-[#CBD5E1]">14 days of purchase</strong>
            and we will refund the full amount to your original payment method.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-semibold text-white text-[22px] mb-3">How to request one</h2>
          <p>
            Email{' '}
            <a href="mailto:support@zarlinoaudio.com" class="text-[#00D4FF] hover:underline">support@zarlinoaudio.com</a>{' '}
            from the address you used at checkout, with a line about what didn't work (it helps us fix
            things). We aim to confirm within 2 business days.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-semibold text-white text-[22px] mb-3">Processing</h2>
          <p>
            Refunds are sent back through Paystack to your original payment method, typically within
            5–10 business days depending on your bank. After a refund, your licence for that product
            ends — please delete the plugin or stop using the key.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-semibold text-white text-[22px] mb-3">Fair use &amp; your rights</h2>
          <p>
            This policy is for genuine purchases by the person who bought the licence; we may decline
            refunds in cases of clear abuse (for example, repeatedly buying and refunding the same
            product). Nothing in this policy limits rights you have under applicable consumer law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <p class="pt-4 border-t border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] text-[13px] text-[#475569]">
          Plain-language version 1.0 — pending legal review. We will publish an updated version once reviewed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
